      "title": "TTL: Optimize Buffer usage",
      "message": "TTL: Optimize Buffer usage\n\nDon't call `ws_buffer_assure_space` before `ws_buffer_append`.\nAdd `ttl_read_bytes_buffer` to avoid duplicate code.\n",
